1. Open VS Code

2. Open Terminal

3. Create React Application:

npx create-react-app reacthooks

4. Open Project:

cd reacthooks

5. Start React Application:

npm start

6. Browser opens:
   http://localhost:3000

7. Open:
   reacthooks → src → App.js

8. Delete old code and paste this code:

import React, { useState, useEffect } from "react";

function App() {

  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);

  useEffect(() => {

    document.title = `Count ${count}`;

  });

  return (

    <div style={{
      textAlign: "center",
      marginTop: "50px"
    }}>

      <h1>React Hooks Example</h1>

      <h2>Count: {count}</h2>

      <button onClick={() => setCount(count + 1)}>
        Increment
      </button>

    </div>

  );
}

export default App;

9. Save file:
   Ctrl + S

10. Output:

React Hooks Example
Count: 0
[Increment Button]

11. Click Increment button

12. Count increases:
    1
    2
    3 ...

13. Hooks Used:
    useState → manages state
    useEffect → updates browser title
